Z||000016||SCCA FIERO||01-26-2000||01:37 AM||||HAHA... I told ya. You playing 1.5 or 2.0? My computer can't keep up with 2.0 so I play 1.5 til I get a better video card. What plane you fly? I like the Yak 3. <P>Since I started playing that game (about a year and a half ago) I can name those old planes by sight. In <I>Saving Private Ryan</I> when that plane flew over and blew up that tank, I knew it was a Mustang P51. My wife thought I was nuts whan I screamed that out.<P>Whats your Zone name? I'm "Bow_Down_B4_Me"<BR>If I see you online we can fly together or against each other. ||||reg||1
Z||000017||batboy||01-26-2000||09:18 PM||||SCCA, I tried all the planes in the novice arena of version 2.0, but mostly settled on the P-40 on the American side because it was so durable. Those Yaks could out-turn me in the P-40, so I usually picked on the British. For some reason I became wicked at flaming the Spitfires. NOTE: in this part of the game it's every country against each other, no allies. I was playing as _battyboy_ last weekend. Don't know yet if I'm going to subscribe, probably will. I used to play the heck out of an old DOS game called "Aces of the Pacific" so I'm not entirely new to this, it's just been a long time.||||reg||1
