Z||000019||SCCA FIERO||01-27-2000||12:19 AM||||Batboy, I know about those P-40s... takes alot of lead to knock one down with the puny guns of the Yak. I like the handeling of the Yak though... can't get away from me  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>baggy, I play MW3 as well, but havent for a couple of months. <P>I know what you mean about 2.0. I think it's a good game if my computer could keep up with it. I like the bombers, except when I have no escort... sitting duck! I usually end up bailing out from the bombers, but it's fun to see the destruction I cause to their strip  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">. Once I was hit by a plane while chuting to the ground... it was kinda funny... I got a kill and a death for it.||||reg||1
